- After each CLI update, check `message.model` of one unpinned child and one `{{ .subagent_tiers.claude.top }}` override.
- Every custom subagent loads `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` and draws the same Max pools (5-hour
  window, shared weekly pool; the frontier model's 50% weekly cap is shared, not reserved); check `/usage`.

## Workflows (verified 2026-09-26)

- The keyword `ultracode` opts one turn into a workflow at session effort; `/effort ultracode`
  is xhigh plus standing workflows, with no size warning and no 20-agent Agent-tool cap. Only the
  driver can start one; concurrency is min(16, CPUs−2); `skipWorkflowUsageWarning: true`
  suppresses auto mode's pre-workflow cost prompt. A bare `agent()` gets the
  `CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL` pin at session effort; `agent({agentType})` the role's pin and effort.
- Workflow agents were 67% of a week's Claude usage (measured 2026-09-26): ~50 calls and
  200–250k context each, 92% of cost cache — fan-out size and per-agent scope drive burn,
  effort barely does.

## Local-only surface (decision 2026-09-21)

- No claude.ai-product surface: account skill/plugin sync, claude.ai connectors and Remote
  Control are off in settings, the cron scheduler by env; `{{ $bare | join "`, `" }}` are
  bare-denied (gone from the tool list); `{{ $scoped | join "`, `" }}` block only the
  matching call. Skill overrides and denies live in agents.yaml (plugin skills follow
  `enabledPlugins`). Web search, Exa, context7 and Playwright stay for research;
  `/code-review ultra` and `claude --cloud` have no disable knob, both user-invoked only.

## Cross-model bridge on pi (decision 2026-09-23)

- `cross-model-review` / `cross-model-advice` are read-only GPT consultations;
  decisions stay in Claude, triggered by risk or breadth (2026-09-03).
  They call the `pi` MCP server (`scripts/pi-bridge.mjs` in the chezmoi repo):
  tools `review`, `advise`, `reply` run pi read-only at the model and effort
  pinned by `agent_mcp_servers.pi`, so callers pick scope only; `review` embeds
  the git diff (git read-only under srt), and `mcp__pi` is allow-listed so it runs
  prompt-free in plan mode. It refuses a cwd under a sandbox-writable scratch root
  or whose `.git` is not its own (2026-09-26): review a real checkout.
